#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119595 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119781 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "3545b168-5226-5f47-ac0d-3ff5509e866e" :question/math-academy-id "e-4447" :question/problem "What is the minor of $a_{13}$ in \n![](images/c0/c0ffc60389d514cccf13932d9cd4e9d9f331034b7f7819e47c967b53cd9fe950.png)" :question/worked-solution "To get the minor of $a_{13}$, we remove the $1$st row and $3$rd column:\n\n![](images/1d/1da3828225d1993dce1eff0ce05a9b3ef5add5bf501a6c329b1c7cf0832e32ea.png)\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n![](images/f1/f14d2fb18786fadd245fe90da5cae6a3f557112a72c151b59d98151b6515264f.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119596 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119782 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "8e61e639-f165-5157-91c0-e9a6faf734a6" :question/math-academy-id "e-4448" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of $d_{23}$ in \n![](images/2b/2b1ce867c1ddc7bfe6e1dcb94594dc529038f48755077e551f6ac6fd5709bd6c.png)" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of $d_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n![](images/80/80c7234f95b4814f64435f32fbd627fabbd0564d7d2f97f69c003c644d96663e.png)\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n![](images/d4/d4b6ca5c1dad2c83a0f7d76f82099645fb1cfb2db3fb7c552f6b8b9a95684b42.png)\n\nNow, the cofactor of $d_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{23} & =(-1)^{2+3}{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119597 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119783 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/id #uuid "3e091496-053c-59fb-90d6-d8fb89ea6004" :question/math-academy-id "e-4449" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n![](images/8a/8af3a07c6f7c326656a7be442b2bdec7e51e63c80d19213727494fce9c7cb720.png)" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & ={a}_{11}{C}_{11}+{a}_{12}{C}_{12}+{a}_{13}{C}_{13}+{a}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+0\\cdot {C}_{12}+2\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =2{C}_{13} \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(-1)^{1+3}|\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(5|\\begin{aligned}6 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 0\\end{aligned}|+0|\\begin{aligned}1 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 3\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =2(5(6\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 3)-(1\\cdot 0-(-1)\\cdot (-6))+0(1\\cdot 3-6\\cdot (-6))) \\\\  & =2(15+6+0) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 21 \\\\  & =42\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265949 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119781 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "270c57e6-7711-5097-a349-a79d2b878209" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 11 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -8 & 8\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263341} {:answer/id #uuid "7bc7509a-b077-596e-b503-a6e0dec66ceb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & 11 & 7 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & -8 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264069} {:answer/id #uuid "93f14d5b-0eb8-557c-b676-9b24c3845b20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\beg